  "title": "Reading temperature from MKI185V1 using MEMS Studio",
  "content": "<p>Hello,</p><p>I would like to evaluate  IIS2MDC mounted on MKI185V1 evaluation board using MEMS Studio. in the “Save to File” section I can choose Timestamp, Magnetometer, Magnetometer [LSB}, and Interrupt 1, but not Temperature, although the device has an internal temperature sensor. my setup:<br />STEVAL-MKI185V1 on STEVAL-MKI109V3, FW: 3.79.1. MEMS Studio ver. 2.4.0 on Windows 11.</p><p>Please advise,</p><p>Shmulik</p>",
